  "title": "見過世面",
  "summary": "怎麼樣叫做「見過世面」呢？",
  "content": "<p>怎麼樣叫做「見過世面」呢？</p>\n<p>是去過<a href=\"https://wiwi.blog/blog/where-did-i-go\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">很多國家</a>？換過很多份<a href=\"https://wiwi.blog/blog/quit-your-job\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">工作</a>？吃過很多高級餐廳？買過許多<a href=\"https://wiwi.blog/blog/luxury-trap\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">精品</a>？用著<a href=\"https://wiwi.blog/blog/iphone-duo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">最新 iPhone</a>？跟名人合照過？知道 Instagram 的最新功能？</p>\n<p>有些人所謂的「世面」，我可能根本不在乎，搞不好還覺得很蠢呢。</p>\n<p>那我是不是也可以反過來說，有些人<a href=\"https://wiwi.blog/blog/pianist-using-linux\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">連 Linux 都沒用過</a>，連 <a href=\"https://wiwi.blog/blog/why-use-markdown\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Markdown</a>、<a href=\"https://wiwi.blog/blog/most-important-software\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">FFmpeg</a> 和 <a href=\"https://wiwi.blog/blog/you-should-use-rss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">RSS</a> 都不知道，才真是沒見過<a href=\"https://wiwi.blog/blog/own-world\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">世面</a>呢！</p>\n<p>但<a href=\"https://wiwi.blog/blog/bj4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">不需要解釋</a>沒關係，只要<a href=\"https://wiwi.blog/blog/should-have-said-that\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">笑笑地回</a>「哇，你好厲害喔，好見過世面喔」就可以了。</p>",
  "image": null,
